Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:13:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Own native CLI socket duplicates through deferred
 spawn

Serialize endpoint duplication with retirement; retain per-spawn ownership through Popen without holding retirement hostage. Preserve cancellation reports and scrub stale locators at common child-environment creation.

Proof: six regression failures before fix; final 1584 focused/scanner tests pass; nine exact lifetime mutants killed; scripts/check passes. Bounded independent delta review found no blockers. Full native guard proof and canonical landing still pending.
